reading the versions
  acts   enter release · n new · e edit · A archive · b assign · s sort · f filter
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first version, G last version]
  full   [enter release this version, n new version, e edit this version, A archive or unarchive it, b put it on issues, or take it off]
  full   [s sort the versions, f filter by state]
counting what is open on one
  acts   n new · e edit · A archive · b assign · s sort · f filter
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first version, G last version]
  full   [n new version, e edit this version, A archive or unarchive it, b put it on issues, or take it off]
  full   [s sort the versions, f filter by state]
typing a version
  acts   ctrl+s save · esc leave it
  full   [tab next field, shift+tab previous field]
  full   [ctrl+s save this version, esc leave it alone]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
a save in flight
  acts   
choosing an order
  acts   ←/h prev · →/l next · enter choose · esc cancel
  full   [←/h previous field, →/l next field]
  full   [enter choose this order, esc leave the order as it is]
